{"id":72,"name":"الجن","transliteration":"Al-Jinn","translation_fr":"Les djinns","translation_en":"The Jinn","type":"meccan","total_verses":28,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"قُلۡ أُوحِيَ إِلَيَّ أَنَّهُ ٱسۡتَمَعَ نَفَرٞ مِّنَ ٱلۡجِنِّ فَقَالُوٓاْ إِنَّا سَمِعۡنَا قُرۡءَانًا عَجَبٗا","translation_fr":"Dis: «Il m'a été révélé qu'un groupe de djinns prêtèrent l'oreille, puis dirent: «Nous avons certes entendu une Lecture [le Coran] merveilleuse","translation_en":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"It has been revealed to me that a group of the jinn listened and said, 'Indeed, we have heard an amazing Qur'an","transliteration":"Qul oohiya ilayya annahu istamaAAa nafarun mina aljinni faqaloo inna samiAAna quranan AAajaban"},{"id":2,"text":"يَهۡدِيٓ إِلَى ٱلرُّشۡدِ فَـَٔامَنَّا بِهِۦۖ وَلَن نُّشۡرِكَ بِرَبِّنَآ أَحَدٗا","translation_fr":"qui guide vers la droiture. Nous y avons cru, et nous n'associerons jamais personne à notre Seigneur","translation_en":"It guides to the right course, and we have believed in it. And we will never associate with our Lord anyone","transliteration":"Yahdee ila alrrushdi faamanna bihi walan nushrika birabbina ahadan"},{"id":3,"text":"وَأَنَّهُۥ تَعَٰلَىٰ جَدُّ رَبِّنَا مَا ٱتَّخَذَ صَٰحِبَةٗ وَلَا وَلَدٗا","translation_fr":"En vérité notre Seigneur - que Sa grandeur soit exaltée - ne S'est donné ni compagne, ni enfant","translation_en":"And [it teaches] that exalted is the nobleness of our Lord; He has not taken a wife or a son","transliteration":"Waannahu taAAala jaddu rabbina ma ittakhatha sahibatan wala waladan"},{"id":4,"text":"وَأَنَّهُۥ كَانَ يَقُولُ سَفِيهُنَا عَلَى ٱللَّهِ شَطَطٗا","translation_fr":"Notre insensé [Iblis] disait des extravagances contre Allah","translation_en":"And that our foolish one has been saying about Allah an excessive transgression","transliteration":"Waannahu kana yaqoolu safeehuna AAala Allahi shatatan"},{"id":5,"text":"وَأَنَّا ظَنَنَّآ أَن لَّن تَقُولَ ٱلۡإِنسُ وَٱلۡجِنُّ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ كَذِبٗا","translation_fr":"Et nous pensions que ni les humains ni les djinns ne sauraient jamais proférer de mensonge contre Allah","translation_en":"And we had thought that mankind and the jinn would never speak about Allah a lie","transliteration":"Waanna thananna an lan taqoola alinsu waaljinnu AAala Allahi kathiban"},{"id":6,"text":"وَأَنَّهُۥ كَانَ رِجَالٞ مِّنَ ٱلۡإِنسِ يَعُوذُونَ بِرِجَالٖ مِّنَ ٱلۡجِنِّ فَزَادُوهُمۡ رَهَقٗا","translation_fr":"Or, il y avait parmi les humains, des mâles qui cherchaient protection auprès des mâles parmi les djinns mais cela ne fit qu'accroître leur détresse","translation_en":"And there were men from mankind who sought refuge in men from the jinn, so they [only] increased them in burden","transliteration":"Waannahu kana rijalun mina alinsi yaAAoothoona birijalin mina aljinni fazadoohum rahaqan"},{"id":7,"text":"وَأَنَّهُمۡ ظَنُّواْ كَمَا ظَنَنتُمۡ أَن لَّن يَبۡعَثَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٗا","translation_fr":"Et ils avaient pensé comme vous avez pensé qu'Allah ne ressusciterait jamais personne","translation_en":"And they had thought, as you thought, that Allah would never send anyone [as a messenger]","transliteration":"Waannahum thannoo kama thanantum an lan yabAAatha Allahu ahadan"},{"id":8,"text":"وَأَنَّا لَمَسۡنَا ٱلسَّمَآءَ فَوَجَدۡنَٰهَا مُلِئَتۡ حَرَسٗا شَدِيدٗا وَشُهُبٗا","translation_fr":"Nous avions frôlé le ciel et nous l'avions trouvé plein d'une forte garde et de bolides","translation_en":"And we have sought [to reach] the heaven but found it filled with powerful guards and burning flames","transliteration":"Waanna lamasna alssamaa fawajadnaha muliat harasan shadeedan washuhuban"},{"id":9,"text":"وَأَنَّا كُنَّا نَقۡعُدُ مِنۡهَا مَقَٰعِدَ لِلسَّمۡعِۖ فَمَن يَسۡتَمِعِ ٱلۡأٓنَ يَجِدۡ لَهُۥ شِهَابٗا رَّصَدٗا","translation_fr":"Nous y prenions place pour écouter. Mais quiconque prête l'oreille maintenant, trouve contre lui un bolide aux aguets","translation_en":"And we used to sit therein in positions for hearing, but whoever listens now will find a burning flame lying in wait for him","transliteration":"Waanna kunna naqAAudu minha maqaAAida lilssamAAi faman yastamiAAi alana yajid lahu shihaban rasadan"},{"id":10,"text":"وَأَنَّا لَا نَدۡرِيٓ أَشَرٌّ أُرِيدَ بِمَن فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ أَمۡ أَرَادَ بِهِمۡ رَبُّهُمۡ رَشَدٗا","translation_fr":"Nous ne savons pas si on veut du mal aux habitants de la terre ou si leur Seigneur veut les mettre sur le droit chemin","translation_en":"And we do not know [therefore] whether evil is intended for those on earth or whether their Lord intends for them a right course","transliteration":"Waanna la nadree asharrun oreeda biman fee alardi am arada bihim rabbuhum rashadan"},{"id":11,"text":"وَأَنَّا مِنَّا ٱلصَّـٰلِحُونَ وَمِنَّا دُونَ ذَٰلِكَۖ كُنَّا طَرَآئِقَ قِدَدٗا","translation_fr":"Il y a parmi nous des vertueux et [d'autres] qui le sont moins: nous étions divisés en différentes sectes","translation_en":"And among us are the righteous, and among us are [others] not so; we were [of] divided ways","transliteration":"Waanna minna alssalihoona waminna doona thalika kunna taraiqa qidadan"},{"id":12,"text":"وَأَنَّا ظَنَنَّآ أَن لَّن نُّعۡجِزَ ٱللَّهَ فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَلَن نُّعۡجِزَهُۥ هَرَبٗا","translation_fr":"Nous pensions bien que nous ne saurions jamais réduire Allah à l'impuissance sur la terre et que nous ne saurions jamais le réduire à l'impuissance en nous enfuyant","translation_en":"And we have become certain that we will never cause failure to Allah upon earth, nor can we escape Him by flight","transliteration":"Wanna thananna an lan nuAAjiza Allaha fee alardi walan nuAAjizahu haraban"},{"id":13,"text":"وَأَنَّا لَمَّا سَمِعۡنَا ٱلۡهُدَىٰٓ ءَامَنَّا بِهِۦۖ فَمَن يُؤۡمِنۢ بِرَبِّهِۦ فَلَا يَخَافُ بَخۡسٗا وَلَا رَهَقٗا","translation_fr":"Et lorsque nous avons entendu le guide [le Coran], nous y avons cru, et quiconque croit en son Seigneur ne craint alors ni diminution de récompense ni oppression","translation_en":"And when we heard the guidance, we believed in it. And whoever believes in his Lord will not fear deprivation or burden","transliteration":"Waanna lamma samiAAna alhuda amanna bihi faman yumin birabbihi fala yakhafu bakhsan wala rahaqan"},{"id":14,"text":"وَأَنَّا مِنَّا ٱلۡمُسۡلِمُونَ وَمِنَّا ٱلۡقَٰسِطُونَۖ فَمَنۡ أَسۡلَمَ فَأُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ تَحَرَّوۡاْ رَشَدٗا","translation_fr":"Il y a parmi nous les Musulmans, et il y en a les injustes [qui ont dévié]. Et ceux qui se sont convertis à l'Islam sont ceux qui ont cherché la droiture","translation_en":"And among us are Muslims [in submission to Allah], and among us are the unjust. And whoever has become Muslim - those have sought out the right course","transliteration":"Waanna minna almuslimoona waminna alqasitoona faman aslama faolaika taharraw rashadan"},{"id":15,"text":"وَأَمَّا ٱلۡقَٰسِطُونَ فَكَانُواْ لِجَهَنَّمَ حَطَبٗا","translation_fr":"Et quant aux injustes, ils formeront le combustible de l'Enfer","translation_en":"But as for the unjust, they will be, for Hell, firewood","transliteration":"Waama alqasitoona fakanoo lijahannama hataban"},{"id":16,"text":"وَأَلَّوِ ٱسۡتَقَٰمُواْ عَلَى ٱلطَّرِيقَةِ لَأَسۡقَيۡنَٰهُم مَّآءً غَدَقٗا","translation_fr":"Et s'ils se maintenaient dans la bonne direction, Nous les aurions abreuvés, certes d'une eau abondante","translation_en":"And [Allah revealed] that if they had remained straight on the way, We would have given them abundant provision","transliteration":"Waallawi istaqamoo AAala alttareeqati laasqaynahum maan ghadaqan"},{"id":17,"text":"لِّنَفۡتِنَهُمۡ فِيهِۚ وَمَن يُعۡرِضۡ عَن ذِكۡرِ رَبِّهِۦ يَسۡلُكۡهُ عَذَابٗا صَعَدٗا","translation_fr":"afin de les y éprouver. Et quiconque se détourne du rappel de son Seigneur, Il l'achemine vers un châtiment sans cesse croissant","translation_en":"So We might test them therein. And whoever turns away from the remembrance of his Lord He will put into arduous punishment","transliteration":"Linaftinahum feehi waman yuAArid AAan thikri rabbihi yaslukhu AAathaban saAAadan"},{"id":18,"text":"وَأَنَّ ٱلۡمَسَٰجِدَ لِلَّهِ فَلَا تَدۡعُواْ مَعَ ٱللَّهِ أَحَدٗا","translation_fr":"Les mosquées sont consacrées à Allah: n'invoquez donc personne avec Allah","translation_en":"And [He revealed] that the masjids are for Allah, so do not invoke with Allah anyone","transliteration":"Waanna almasajida lillahi fala tadAAoo maAAa Allahi ahadan"},{"id":19,"text":"وَأَنَّهُۥ لَمَّا قَامَ عَبۡدُ ٱللَّهِ يَدۡعُوهُ كَادُواْ يَكُونُونَ عَلَيۡهِ لِبَدٗا","translation_fr":"Et quand le serviteur d'Allah s'est mis debout pour L'invoquer, ils faillirent se ruer en masse sur lui","translation_en":"And that when the Servant of Allah stood up supplicating Him, they almost became about him a compacted mass","transliteration":"Waannahu lamma qama AAabdu Allahi yadAAoohu kadoo yakoonoona AAalayhi libadan"},{"id":20,"text":"قُلۡ إِنَّمَآ أَدۡعُواْ رَبِّي وَلَآ أُشۡرِكُ بِهِۦٓ أَحَدٗا","translation_fr":"Dis: «Je n'invoque que mon Seigneur et ne Lui associe personne»","translation_en":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"I only invoke my Lord and do not associate with Him anyone","transliteration":"Qul innama adAAoo rabbee wala oshriku bihi ahadan"},{"id":21,"text":"قُلۡ إِنِّي لَآ أَمۡلِكُ لَكُمۡ ضَرّٗا وَلَا رَشَدٗا","translation_fr":"Dis: «Je ne possède aucun moyen pour vous faire du mal, ni pour vous mettre sur le chemin droit»","translation_en":"Say, \"Indeed, I do not possess for you [the power of] harm or right direction","transliteration":"Qul innee la amliku lakum darran wala rashadan"},{"id":22,"text":"قُلۡ إِنِّي لَن يُجِيرَنِي مِنَ ٱللَّهِ أَحَدٞ وَلَنۡ أَجِدَ مِن دُونِهِۦ مُلۡتَحَدًا","translation_fr":"Dis: «Vraiment, personne ne saura me protéger contre Allah; et jamais je ne trouverai de refuge en dehors de Lui","translation_en":"Say, \"Indeed, there will never protect me from Allah anyone [if I should disobey], nor will I find in other than Him a refuge","transliteration":"Qul innee lan yujeeranee mina Allahi ahadun walan ajida min doonihi multahadan"},{"id":23,"text":"إِلَّا بَلَٰغٗا مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ وَرِسَٰلَٰتِهِۦۚ وَمَن يَعۡصِ ٱللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُۥ فَإِنَّ لَهُۥ نَارَ جَهَنَّمَ خَٰلِدِينَ فِيهَآ أَبَدًا","translation_fr":"[Je ne puis que transmettre] une communication et des messages [émanant] d'Allah. Et quiconque désobéit à Allah et à Son Messager aura le feu de l'Enfer pour y demeurer éternellement","translation_en":"But [I have for you] only notification from Allah, and His messages.\" And whoever disobeys Allah and His Messenger - then indeed, for him is the fire of Hell; they will abide therein forever","transliteration":"Illa balaghan mina Allahi warisalatihi waman yaAAsi Allaha warasoolahu fainna lahu nara jahannama khalideena feeha abadan"},{"id":24,"text":"حَتَّىٰٓ إِذَا رَأَوۡاْ مَا يُوعَدُونَ فَسَيَعۡلَمُونَ مَنۡ أَضۡعَفُ نَاصِرٗا وَأَقَلُّ عَدَدٗا","translation_fr":"Puis, quand ils verront ce dont on les menaçait, ils sauront lesquels ont les secours les plus faibles et [lesquels] sont les moins nombreux","translation_en":"[The disbelievers continue] until, when they see that which they are promised, then they will know who is weaker in helpers and less in number","transliteration":"Hatta itha raaw ma yooAAadoona fasayaAAlamoona man adAAafu nasiran waaqallu AAadadan"},{"id":25,"text":"قُلۡ إِنۡ أَدۡرِيٓ أَقَرِيبٞ مَّا تُوعَدُونَ أَمۡ يَجۡعَلُ لَهُۥ رَبِّيٓ أَمَدًا","translation_fr":"Dis: «Je ne sais pas si ce dont vous êtes menacés est proche, ou bien, si mon Seigneur va lui assigner un délai","translation_en":"Say, \"I do not know if what you are promised is near or if my Lord will grant for it a [long] period","transliteration":"Qul in adree aqareebun ma tooAAadoona am yajAAalu lahu rabbee amadan"},{"id":26,"text":"عَٰلِمُ ٱلۡغَيۡبِ فَلَا يُظۡهِرُ عَلَىٰ غَيۡبِهِۦٓ أَحَدًا","translation_fr":"[C'est Lui] qui connaît le mystère. Il ne dévoile Son mystère à personne","translation_en":"[He is] Knower of the unseen, and He does not disclose His [knowledge of the] unseen to anyone","transliteration":"AAalimu alghaybi fala yuthhiru AAala ghaybihi ahadan"},{"id":27,"text":"إِلَّا مَنِ ٱرۡتَضَىٰ مِن رَّسُولٖ فَإِنَّهُۥ يَسۡلُكُ مِنۢ بَيۡنِ يَدَيۡهِ وَمِنۡ خَلۡفِهِۦ رَصَدٗا","translation_fr":"sauf à celui qu'Il agrée comme Messager et qu'Il fait précéder et suivre de gardiens vigilants","translation_en":"Except whom He has approved of messengers, and indeed, He sends before each messenger and behind him observers","transliteration":"Illa mani irtada min rasoolin fainnahu yasluku min bayni yadayhi wamin khalfihi rasadan"},{"id":28,"text":"لِّيَعۡلَمَ أَن قَدۡ أَبۡلَغُواْ رِسَٰلَٰتِ رَبِّهِمۡ وَأَحَاطَ بِمَا لَدَيۡهِمۡ وَأَحۡصَىٰ كُلَّ شَيۡءٍ عَدَدَۢا","translation_fr":"afin qu'Il sache s'ils ont bien transmis les messages de leur Seigneur. Il cerne (de Son savoir) ce qui est avec eux, et dénombre exactement toute chose","translation_en":"That he may know that they have conveyed the messages of their Lord; and He has encompassed whatever is with them and has enumerated all things in number","transliteration":"LiyaAAlama an qad ablaghoo risalati rabbihim waahata bima ladayhim waahsa kulla shayin AAadadan"}]}